{"title":"Oak Longbow","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Bowyer Lv 21) · Monster drop: Dune Marauder, Thak Footman, Dune Skirmisher, Warleader Grask, Hill Giant Titan +3 more</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-req\"><b>Requires</b> Lvl 15 · DEX 45 <span class=\"muted\">to equip</span></p>\n      <h2>Skill needed</h2><p>Wielding it takes the <a href=\"#/guide/special-attacks\"><b>Bow</b> weapon skill</a>. <b>Archers</b> start with it. Everyone else can study a <b>Bow tome</b> (1 skill point; vendors no longer sell them, so look on the Exchange).</p><p class=\"muted\">See <a href=\"#/guide/special-attacks\">Weapon skills &amp; specials</a> for how the skill levels and what it unlocks.</p>\n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Bowyer at level 21 <span class=\"muted\">(899 XP)</span> from 6× <a href=\"#/item/oak-wood\">Oak Wood</a>, 6× <a href=\"#/item/wool\">Wool</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"warleader-grask\" title=\"Warleader Grask - dropped it in 1 of 1 looted corpses (1/1)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/8f5848d911f71abdd2a5.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Warleader Grask</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"pirate-sea-witch\" title=\"Mother Brack, The Sea Witch - dropped it in 1 of 3 looted corpses (1/3)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/8193c37ec86184d63047.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mother Brack, The Sea Witch</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/3<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"kobold-trapper\" title=\"Kobold Trapper - dropped it in 1 of 11 looted corpses (1/11)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/67e32c17ae4f4cf34bb9.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Kobold Trapper</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/11<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"dune-marauder\" title=\"Dune Marauder - dropped it in 1 of 25 looted corpses (1/25)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/ff050e5359d57a891f04.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dune Marauder</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/25<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+4 more\">+4 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"hill-giant-titan\" title=\"Hill Giant Titan - dropped it in 1 of 28 looted corpses (1/28)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/d99cb5199dc9fe13caf8.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Hill Giant Titan</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/28<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"bandit\" title=\"Venn The Crateminder - dropped it in 1 of 132 looted corpses (1/132)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/ff4346e97bf14a389685.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Venn The Crateminder</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/132<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"dune-skirmisher\" title=\"Dune Skirmisher - dropped it in 1 of 300 looted corpses (1/300)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/dbfd07e1b3cf612d0e3f.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dune Skirmisher</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/300<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"thak-footman\" title=\"Thak Footman - dropped it in 1 of 1,186 looted corpses (1/1,186)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/7bd0bd081dd39324d454.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Thak Footman</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1,186<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"oak-longbow\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/bowyer\">Bowyer</a></p>\n      <h2>Quality</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Quality\"><a class=\"q-chip q-all\" href=\"#/item/oak-longbow\">All</a><a class=\"q-chip q-inferior\" href=\"#/item/oak-longbow?q=inferior\">Inferior</a><a class=\"q-chip q-crude\" href=\"#/item/oak-longbow?q=crude\">Crude</a><a class=\"q-chip q-shoddy\" href=\"#/item/oak-longbow?q=shoddy\">Shoddy</a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/oak-longbow?q=ordinary\">Ordinary <span>4</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-good\" href=\"#/item/oak-longbow?q=good\">Good <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on q-excellent\" href=\"#/item/oak-longbow?q=excellent\">Excellent <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-superior\" href=\"#/item/oak-longbow?q=superior\">Superior</a><a class=\"q-chip q-flawless\" href=\"#/item/oak-longbow?q=flawless\">Flawless</a></div><div class=\"q-picker w-ench\" data-gear=\"oak-longbow\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Enchant\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip on\" data-wench=\"\">No enchant</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"destruction\">Destruction</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"burn\">Flame</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"freeze\">Freezing</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"shock\">Storm</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"corrode\">Corrosion</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"seeking\">Seeking</button></div>\n      <p class=\"